<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Hammana Lebanon Airstrike, 1983</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Hammana, Lebanon Airstrike, 1983&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Al “Beirutdude” Sandrik&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;The Time Is: 3 December 1983, 20:00 Zulu/22:00 Beirut Time&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Eastern Mediterranean Sea&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Playable as USN “Air Strike”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;10 Hours Duration&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;This is a very simple airstrike scenario Complexity 1/Difficuty 1&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Background: The air strike on Lebanon on 4 December 1984 was as confused for its rational as it was botched operationally. The rational for it has been debated as a revenge strike for the Beirut BLT Bombing, but officially it was due to the AAA batteries opening up on F-14 TARPs Recon missions on 3 December. The USS Kennedy CVBG was preparing to depart and transit the Suez Canal and her bombs&amp;nbsp;had been&amp;nbsp;stored and had to be broken out. The raid was originally scheduled for 11:00 a.m. but the change to 06:30, by Washington ensured they target would be obscured by low cloudiness and ground fog/haze (trust me Lebanon is known for it!). The strike had to come in at low levels and was subject to ground fire. Historically an A-7,E was hit and went down over the Med with the CAG rescued. An A-6E was shot down over Lebanon with the loss of the pilot and capture of the Navigator Lt Goodman USN.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Can you do better?&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Mission, National Command Authority (NCA) wishes you to strike at the anti-aircraft systems along the Beirut-Damascus Highway near Hammana, Lebanon. The mission has been altered several ties and the aircraft load outs changed. The strike was originally set for 09;00 Zulu/11:00 Beirut time but now NCA wishes you to strike at 04:30 Zulu/06:30 Local Time. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;You will notice you do not command the carriers they just stay on “Bagel Station" You have the aircraft (as far as I can derive them) from the mission with 10 A-6Es from Kennedy with 2 EA-6Bs for support. 8 A-7Es and 6 A-6Es take off from Independence with 2 EA-6Bs for support. If I did my math right that is the 28 planes which were historically involved in the raid.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;There are no escorts for carriers, sorry there is absolutely no threat to them and thus no need for escorts. Please just consider the two carriers to be a CVBG, or floating/moving single unit airfield.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;There is a high penalty for the loss of USN aircraft, -500 Victory Points each, to simulate the dismay in Washington and with the American public over losses. Loose two aircraft and it is pretty much over for you!&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Good luck Commander!&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;.INI and Delta Files are provided for deep rebuilds.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;Al “BeirutDude” Sandrik (ex-Beachinnole)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>1</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>1</Difficulty>
  <ScenSetting>Hammana, Lebanon</ScenSetting>
  <ScenDate>1983</ScenDate>
